                "source": "Sprout Social",
                "text": "In 2023, no one in America should go hungry.\n \nI've introduced the Improving Access to Nutrition Act, which will cut through red tape and expand access to SNAP benefits so more folks can get the healthy food they need.   \nhttps://t.co/yYa0wNJjAS",
