                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Sprout Social",
                "text": "Congress has spent too much time on Big Ag, and too little time on nutrition, sustainable farming, and the well-being of agricultural workers.\n \nI\u2019m introducing two bills with @RepCasar today that will protect farmworkers on the job and support small farms around the country. https://t.co/QBgxnFnyGW",
