                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Sprout Social",
                "text": "We need to make it easier for folks to get connected to the nutrition assistance programs they need, not harder.\n \nI'm introducing the Streamlining Nutrition Paperwork Act with my colleagues to cut through red tape and reduce hunger in America.",
