                "source": "Sprout Social",
                "text": "Republicans have introduced a resolution allowing discrimination in nutrition assistance programs. \n \nThere are 12,000 kids in Vermont facing hunger right now. We should be focused on feeding them, not discriminating against them.\n \nI will vote no.",
